{
  "_doc": "Short-form clips (npm run clips; scripts/clips.mjs). Segments cut takes from a mark ('spin0', 'reveal+1.2') for a length at a speed; caption times are seconds or '<segment>:<mark>[+-s]'. Caption lines: at most 2, at most 5 words, *word* = accent; at: top | mid | low. Every caption must say what the game really does: each record shown is the app's own output for that season, and a caption may only repeat it. No dashes in captions (16-1 is a record, written with a hyphen). No club names or marks: the app shows cities and abbreviations only, and the clips add none.",
  "size": {
    "width": 1080,
    "height": 1920
  },
  "style": {
    "fonts": [
      {
        "family": "Rajdhani",
        "file": "node_modules/@expo-google-fonts/rajdhani/700Bold/Rajdhani_700Bold.ttf",
        "weight": 700
      },
      {
        "family": "Montserrat",
        "file": "node_modules/@expo-google-fonts/montserrat/800ExtraBold/Montserrat_800ExtraBold.ttf",
        "weight": 800
      }
    ],
    "font": "'Rajdhani', sans-serif",
    "weight": 700,
    "size": 118,
    "minSize": 96,
    "stroke": 18,
    "tracking": "0.01em",
